PLASMA(1)

NAME
    plasma - display a graphical plasma demo

SYNOPSIS
    plasma

DESCRIPTION
    Starts a graphical plasma animation demo using the SmallOS framebuffer.
    The program renders a fixed animation and returns to the shell when the
    animation finishes.

KEYS
    Press any key to stop the animation early and return to the shell.

SEE ALSO
    mandel(1), fractint(1), bmpview(1)
